{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1769512559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/99e7aa88bce9bb6d8af3c6dd6c023fb2.avif?t=1769512559 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the Cat named Gossamergoober accompanied with an awesome groovy original sound track.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, collect chicken and catch the bugs in this adorable platformer for anyone that loves cats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good for beginner gamers to learning PC gaming and/or keyboard platforming and/or controller gamepad platforming.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes various casual fun\u00a0game modes and stages</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch the Bugs Mode involves catching all of the bugs before\u00a0Gossamergoober runs out of energy and falls asleep.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Barnicle Mode involves searching for and finding Barnicle the Elder Cat. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1769512559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/115f838a95a40a5394474725e7b32de0.avif?t=1769512559 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set times for completing stages and try and get your best times for each mode and stage completion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for collectable music boxes and unlock the playable OST sound tracks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various challenge Trophies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access options that change the gameplay accessibility (example: removing the background) for casual play and/or music options.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1769512559\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3469470/extras_big/9224bd19a0212033cdf8167751e12ec0.avif?t=1769512559 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Got the Bugs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/9cbf0f5abab7ec68ee33736126db1d67ed141f01.jpg"},{"name":"Off the Walls","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/c8c259a03c88b574389203aef5c5e87c8cbd8d17.jpg"},{"name":"Prowler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/0552a2c5d95ba9b9314b5aa667f02dfd231b0b56.jpg"},{"name":"Shadow Kitty","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/2824201b4bf623b194626d556f9233cdc5757534.jpg"},{"name":"Cold Paws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/a95614dc2a6a9e7be99719d2c58cf24a44ee5f35.jpg"},{"name":"Happy Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/72fe6ce45967b28f02ad5f4ed5cd7d8b3514ba41.jpg"},{"name":"Goobin","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/6cea6ddd4d1ac21975bd56a82e9c6c31a389f548.jpg"},{"name":"Curious Cat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3469470/25e65e9503c9f8e31af91031ce65e85fb158f07b.jpg"},{"name":"Sleep Disturber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/i